{"content":[{"c":["PUAH"],"sourceClass":"h1","t":"p"},{"c":["1. One of two Hebrew midwives ordered by Pharaoh to kill Hebrew males at birth. However, she feared God and did not carry out the order (",{"href":"?bref=Exod.1.15","r":"Exod.1.15","rawR":"Exod.1.15","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Exod.1.15","value":"Exod.1.15"}],"t":"ref","v":"Ex 1:15"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["2. Father of Tola, a judge of Israel (",{"href":"?bref=Judg.10.1","r":"Judg.10.1","rawR":"Judg.10.1","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Judg.10.1","value":"Judg.10.1"}],"t":"ref","v":"Jgs 10:1"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["3. Alternate form of Puvah, Issachar’s son, in ",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.7.1","r":"1Chr.7.1","rawR":"1Chr.7.1","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.7.1","value":"1Chr.7.1"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chronicles 7:1"},". ",{"c":["See"],"sourceClass":"ital","t":"span"}," ",{"href":"?item=Puvah_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","id":"Puvah_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","rawId":"Puvah_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","t":"link","v":"Puvah"},"."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"}],"format":"bsb-study-dictionary-v2","id":"Puah","provenance":{"archiveSha256":"10758ea00dbea7540f9337e43e59c8e4000295c1261e3426bab6f31c31dcff5b","release":"1.6","sourceCitationReferences":[{"anchorText":"Ex 1:15","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Exod.1.15","rawQueryValue":"Exod.1.15","sourceRefExact":"Exod.1.15"},{"anchorText":"Jgs 10:1","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Judg.10.1","rawQueryValue":"Judg.10.1","sourceRefExact":"Judg.10.1"},{"anchorText":"1 Chronicles 7:1","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Chr.7.1","rawQueryValue":"1Chr.7.1","sourceRefExact":"1Chr.7.1"}],"sourceItemFragmentSha256":"d3b9fbbe969baf64c5d5d00faf3733b427708c484818b327a16e78d527aaffb9","sourceItemName":"Puah","sourceItemOrder":304,"sourceMember":"Articles/P.xml","supplementPointersNotIncludedAsC